      "content": "wait r u sure?? it just feels like a weird swelling from the allergies i always get. ive taken like two benadryl already and i feel okay otherwise. i really dont want to go to the er if i can just sleep it off, it's so expensive. can't i just take more of the antihistamine to make the throat thing go away?",
